-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components (NOT covered by the MIT license above)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following are separate libraries, built from their upstream sources and
linked dynamically. Their licenses apply to them. Exact versions and source
locations of each build are recorded in BUILDINFO.txt inside every bundle, and
the full license texts are in its licenses/ folder.

  libfprint            LGPL-2.1-or-later  https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/libfprint/libfprint
  patches/libfprint/*  LGPL-2.1-or-later  (modifications to libfprint, this repository)
  GLib                 LGPL-2.1-or-later  https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/glib
  libgusb              LGPL-2.1-or-later  https://github.com/hughsie/libgusb
  libusb               LGPL-2.1-or-later  https://github.com/libusb/libusb
  PCRE2 (via GLib)     BSD-3-Clause       https://github.com/PCRE2Project/pcre2
  libffi (via GLib)    MIT                https://github.com/libffi/libffi

docs/PROTOCOL-06cb-00f0.md describes observed USB traffic and refers to
libfprint's drivers/synaptics/ (LGPL-2.1) as the reference implementation.
